# ── Publish only the rendered deck ─────────────────────────────────
# Everything is ignored by default. Only the deck files explicitly
# allowed below are tracked and pushed to GitHub Pages. Anything new
# you drop anywhere at the top level stays private automatically.

/*

# --- allow the deck ---
!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/index.html
!/01-vision.html
!/02-plan.html
!/03-team.html
!/css/
!/js/
!/video/
!/images/

# --- but keep these out of images/ ---
/images/External Reference Images/
/images/example-space*
